   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "第二十二条　网络数据处理者基于个人同意处理个人信息的，应当遵守下列规定："
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-network-data-security-regs-2024:22/s2",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "prohibition",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "（一）收集个人信息为提供产品或者服务所必需，不得超范围收集个人信息，不得通过误导、欺诈、胁迫等方式取得个人同意；"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-network-data-security-regs-2024:22/s3",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "（二）处理生物识别、宗教信仰、特定身份、医疗健康、金融账户、行踪轨迹等敏感个人信息的，应当取得个人的单独同意；"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-network-data-security-regs-2024:22/s4",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "（三）处理不满十四周岁未成年人个人信息的，应当取得未成年人的父母或者其他监护人的同意；"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-network-data-security-regs-2024:22/s5",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "prohibition",
   "evidence_kind": "SUBMITTED",
   "rule": "zh:internal-record",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "（四）不得超出个人同意的个人信息处理目的、方式、种类、保存期限处理个人信息；"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-network-data-security-regs-2024:22/s6",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "prohibition",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "（五）不得在个人明确表示不同意处理其个人信息后，频繁征求同意；"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-network-data-security-regs-2024:22/s7",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "（六）个人信息的处理目的、方式、种类发生变更的，应当重新取得个人同意。"
  },
  {
   "obligation_id": "CN-network-data-security-regs-2024:22/s8",
   "paragraph": null,
   "addressee": "UNRESOLVED",
   "modality": "duty",
   "evidence_kind": "UNTRIAGED",
   "rule": "no-rule-matched",
   "status": "DRAFT",
   "text": "法律、行政法规规定处理敏感个人信息应当取得书面同意的，从其规定。"
  }
 ],
